  "sourceTitle": "Salad Dressing Greek Or Italian",
  "sourceText": "Salad Dressing Greek Or Italian\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 17, 2009 - 11:33pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 cup vinegar\n1/4 cup olive oil\n1/4 cup salad oil\n1/2 teaspoon salt\n2 pinches of ground black pepper\n1/2 teaspoon oregano\n2 whole cloves of garlic, split\nSalad greens\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine in jar. Shake well, let stand at least 1/2 hour before serving. Remove garlic clove after pouring it over salad greens.",
